              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi Ho
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mi Top
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Ho(Top)
            correspond to the reduced K-theory of
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/BU%28n%29"}
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
